Recommends: fonts-noto-cjk, fonts-noto-core
Description: fast, native Spotify client for the desktop
 Fastpotify is a lightweight Spotify client written in Rust with egui,
 playing music through librespot. It starts in well under a second and stays
 small while it runs; there is no browser engine anywhere in the process.
 .
 It is a Spotify Connect device in its own right, plays music on this
 computer, and controls playback on every other device on the account. The
 whole library is there: playlists, Liked Songs, saved albums, followed
 artists, podcasts and episodes, with search, artist, album and playlist
 pages, a queue, lyrics, media keys, and a tray icon that keeps the music
 playing when the window is closed.
 .
 Local playback needs a Spotify Premium account.
